{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">羅皓誼憑藉甜美樣貌與精緻「童顏」，近年在TVB處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》中飾演「卜卜脆」一角而逐漸為人熟知。日前她更解鎖新身份，獲邀加入TVB兒童節目《Hands Up》擔任嘉賓主持，化身「皓誼姐姐」以活潑親切的形象帶領小朋友做運動及玩遊戲，深受小觀眾與家長喜愛。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3831cfa5-d3ff-44d6-a720-4b1bb4197b69.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026KN3i2EvjAe1788316942.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3831cfa5-d3ff-44d6-a720-4b1bb4197b69.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">羅皓誼最近趁着工作空檔前往主題樂園放鬆身心，並於社交平台分享了一輯充滿夢幻少女感的打卡靚相大派福利。相片中，她身穿紅白格仔短袖上衣，搭配白色蕾絲蛋糕短裙同兔耳髮箍，整體造型少女感十足。大批網民及粉絲看後紛紛熱烈留言：「皓誼姐姐好甜」、「童顏無敵」、「公主終於返屋企！」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"32ba4a22-9526-4aff-ab47-ed73aced089b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YP2BbPozCr1788316942.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"32ba4a22-9526-4aff-ab47-ed73aced089b.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3662aafa-a63e-4904-b527-c9b93f3ef909.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202623yhuooEue1788316941.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3662aafa-a63e-4904-b527-c9b93f3ef909.jpg.webp\"/></div></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T10:55:41.520109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}